Sar peet ke chillayi ye masooma e muztar, maajaye baradar<br>
<br>
Pardes me kis simt tumhe dhoonde ye qwahar, maajaye baradar<br>
<br>
1. Mai shouq e ziyarat me watan chod ke aayi, par milne na paayi<br>
<br>
Kya daagh dikhaaye ho mujhe haye baradar, maajaye baradar<br>
<br>
2. Mai reh gayi hayhaat teri yaad me rote, muh ashkou se dhote<br>
<br>
Tum ne naa uthaya mera taboot baradar, maajaye baradar<br>
<br>
3. Jis waqt tere tan pa ayaa'n sam ka asar tha, kya haal tha bhaiyya<br>
<br>
Batlaao sarhaane tha koi yawar o naser, maajaye baradar<br>
<br>
4. Tha koun qaree'n aapke aye sayyad e qushqoo, ya thaamne baazu<br>
<br>
Betaab huwe honge jo thaame dil e muztar, maajaye baradar<br>
<br>
5. Bhaiyya kaho jab aaqri hichki tumhe aayi, aye haq ke fidaai<br>
<br>
Tha kounse hamdard ke zaano pa tera sar, maajaye baradar